      "fullBody": "<p>Serums have a lighter, more fluid texture than creams and contain a higher concentration of active ingredients. They penetrate deeper into the skin and deliver targeted actives exactly where they are needed. That makes them the most impactful step in any routine.</p>\n\n<p>At SESE, we offer three serums, each with its own focus and moment of use. You do not need to use all three at once. Choose what suits your skin and your goals.</p>\n\n<h2>Vitamin C Serum - for glow and protection during the day</h2>\n\n<p>The Vitamin C Serum is the ideal choice when you want to work on an even, luminous complexion during the day. Vitamin C is a powerful antioxidant that neutralises free radicals: the harmful molecules produced by UV radiation, pollution and stress, which play a central role in skin aging.</p>\n\n<p>Vitamin C also stimulates collagen production and helps reduce pigmentation spots. Our serum contains a stable form of Vitamin C combined with Ferulic Acid, which significantly increases effectiveness and shelf life.</p>\n\n<p><em>✦ &nbsp;For whom: women working on a more even complexion, glow and daytime protection.</em><br/><em>✦ &nbsp;When: in the morning, after toner, before day cream and SPF.</em></p>\n\n<h2>Peptide Serum - for firmness and elasticity, day and night</h2>\n\n<p>The Peptide Serum is our most versatile serum and therefore the perfect choice for those just starting out. Peptides are short chains of amino acids that act as messengers for the skin: they stimulate the production of collagen and elastin, making the skin feel firmer and smoother.</p>\n\n<p>Our Peptide Serum contains Dipalmitoyl Hydroxyproline and Hexapeptide-11, combined with Hyaluronic Acid for intense hydration. Suitable for normal to dry skin, morning and evening.</p>\n\n<p><em>✦ &nbsp;For whom: anyone starting with anti-aging, or who wants firm, hydrated skin.</em><br/><em>✦ &nbsp;When: morning and/or evening, after toner.</em></p>\n\n<h2>Retinol Alternative Serum - for cell renewal and texture at night</h2>\n\n<p>Classic retinol is one of the most researched anti-aging ingredients in the world, but it can also be irritating, especially for sensitive skin. Our Retinol Alternative Serum contains Bidens Pilosa Extract, a plant-based alternative that stimulates cell renewal and improves skin texture without the typical irritation of retinol.</p>\n\n<p>Combined with Aloe Juice, Jojoba Oil and Hyaluronic Acid, this serum softens and hydrates while it works. Ideal for the evening routine, when the skin is most active in its repair processes.</p>\n\n<p><em>✦ &nbsp;For whom: women working on fine lines, uneven texture and dull complexion.</em><br/><em>✦ &nbsp;When: in the evening, after toner, before night cream.</em></p>\n\n<h2>Still not sure which serum you need?</h2>\n\n<p>Start with the Peptide Serum. It is the most accessible serum in our collection, suitable for all skin types and without risk of irritation. You can always complement it later with the Vitamin C Serum in the morning, or the Retinol Alternative in the evening.</p>\n\n<p>Our Forever Routine includes the Peptide Serum as the default choice, for exactly that reason.</p>"
